# Top-level tests that fail in every GC_TEST_SPLIT_STRICT=1 run of this package.
# Format: <test>\t<reason>. A reason is required. Regenerate with
# scripts/split-strict-baseline (two or more full runs; a test that failed in
# some runs but not all is refused unless it is in split_strict_known_flaky.list).
# A test new to the list gets an "UNTRIAGED: <first log line>" reason, which
# fails the gate's TESTS verdict and TestSplitStrictGateInputsParse until it is
# replaced with why the test fails under the gate.
# The nightly downward ratchet (--check) fails on an entry that now passes.
